@BB_PACKAGE_TITLE@ (@BB_PACKAGE_NAME@ @BB_PACKAGE_VERSION@), built on Breadbin-6502 @PROJECT_VERSION@

No game ROMs are included. You supply your own dump through the program's menu;
it is only read, never copied or changed.

