floooh/sokol      zlib      window, graphics, audio
Dear ImGui        MIT       menus
tomlc17           MIT       settings files
stb_image         MIT / public domain   PNG loading, inflate
nativefiledialog-extended   zlib   file dialogs (Linux, Windows, macOS)
MEGA65 Open ROMs  LGPL-3.0-or-later   the built-in C64 system ROMs
